  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/e4TeVgY.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fyxvi8i.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/適用於 Minecraft-1.19-ecebe6?labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge\" width=\"248\" height=\"28\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/安裝於-用戶端與伺服器端-ecebe6?labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge\" width=\"240\" height=\"28\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/horse-expert/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=2020709689:7498\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3yrSsw7\" width=\"320\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/puzzles-lib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3jr9xQw\" width=\"215\" height=\"28\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/horse-expert/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=2020709689:7499\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3nRXr4m\" width=\"325\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/30lZmFY\" width=\"208\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/puzzles-lib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3jr9xQw\" width=\"215\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forge-config-api-port-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3clkhvn\" width=\"299\" height=\"28\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fyxvi8i.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>📖 介紹：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>馬術專家</strong>透過顯示所有相關的馬匹數據，大大幫助你挑選值得信賴的坐騎。但等等，可不是這麼簡單！你必須先合成並裝備一個單片眼鏡。然後只需看著一匹馬，就能了解其詳細資訊（馬匹必須已被馴服，但可透過設定調整）。這個功能也適用於羊駝，並附帶額外資訊！</span></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fyxvi8i.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>📷 圖片：</strong></span></p><table style=\"text-align:center\"><tbody><tr><td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/491/961/2022-08-31_22.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td><td>  </td><td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/491/962/2022-08-31_22.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td></tr><tr><td><strong>誰能想到你的馬這麼厲害？</strong></td><td>  </td><td><strong>一隻普通的羊駝</strong></td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/491/963/2022-08-31_22.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td><td>  </td><td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/491/964/2022-08-31_22.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td></tr><tr><td><strong>知識淵博，風格出眾</strong></td><td>  </td><td><strong>合成單片眼鏡物品</strong></td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td></tr></tbody></table><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fyxvi8i.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>💡 常見問題：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>問：如何在 Forge 上設定此模組？</strong><br><strong>答：</strong>安裝我的 <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/config-menus-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Config Menus for Forge</strong></span></a> 模組，然後直接在遊戲內進行設定！</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>問：如何在 Fabric 上設定此模組？</strong><br><strong>答：</strong>目前尚未實現在遊戲內直接編輯設定檔的功能。請在世界中執行 <code>/config showfile &lt;modid&gt;</code> 指令，並選擇 <code>CLIENT</code> 或 <code>SERVER</code>（取決於模組類型），然後點擊聊天中出現的檔案名稱（以 .toml 結尾），即可在獨立的編輯器中手動編輯設定檔。儲存檔案後，設定會在幾秒鐘後自動在遊戲中重新載入，無需重新啟動遊戲。</span></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fyxvi8i.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>🏆 致謝：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Easy Magic</strong> 的開發受到了以下幫助和啟發：</span></p><ul><li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/teaj4y\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>TeaJ4y</strong></span></a> 從他們的 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/horsestatsvanilla\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Horse Stats Vanilla</span></a> 模組啟發了這個項目</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/ron0\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Ron0</strong></span></a> 創作了這些華麗的單片眼鏡紋理</span></li></ul><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fyxvi8i.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/lunapixelstudios/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=CurseForge&amp;message=LunaPixelStudios&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"282\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://twitter.com/LunaPixelStudio\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitter/follow/LunaPixelStudio?label=Twitter&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=twitter&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"149\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/8ZmhaPPbjE\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790272037578473512?label=Discord&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"220\" height=\"28\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1MOyd2u.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"300\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Fuzs_&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"97\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\" rel=\"nofollow\"